   "title": "3-term lawmaker with N. Korea expertise tapped as unification minister",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261123/3-term-lawmaker-with-n-korea-expertise-tapped-as-unification-minister",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
